    <mdiv type="solesmes">
      <score>
        <section>
          <pb xml:id="m-ce0387ad-e894-4cef-a55b-9d02fc979ad8" n="1984" facs="#m-a51296d0-c9d4-4dd6-9cb7-eeb5951ca58c" /><div xml:id="m-d9099e71-0444-44be-bb01-0cf2e7b7c69e">
            <lg xml:id="m-7e723dad-0f4b-4fa2-9a89-c71bb3923ed6">
              <l xml:id="m-6ccc8027-5619-4cba-b3a5-177892be8413" facs="#m-c4babde2-819f-467a-96fa-f8d490a508c9" label="ambiguous">1738</l><l xml:id="m-3113c479-1064-41de-80df-4d597a668ad7" facs="#m-3ecb5969-06d9-4046-a174-07d853e2392b" label="ambiguous">November 2.</l><l xml:id="m-c6081b91-7e96-42e5-83af-2158a7edfe39" facs="#m-12da96a1-2d9f-4a0e-afc2-9af0bad76d6a" label="lyrics-like">Réquiem aetérnam* dóna éis,</l><l xml:id="m-ee56b844-25b6-433b-b515-882f4d5fb650" facs="#m-5285ef31-c443-4d2c-919a-fc72f7fef970" label="lyrics-like">Cor méum conturbátum est,t de¬</l><l xml:id="m-9b69d976-8996-407b-97e5-8568d23cad17" facs="#m-2ad37bb4-ac77-431c-9fb5-56ebc03b1c99" label="lyrics-like">pómine.</l><l xml:id="m-a2f9262a-4454-4c91-b831-57b8a543c3f5" facs="#m-8b97b6ba-9a6d-43b3-8041-482f883bb929" label="lyrics-like">reliquit me virtus méa :* et lúmen</l><l xml:id="m-55cf2192-1bf9-41e7-9a52-8a86738e9637" facs="#m-e87a2375-1255-4251-9689-210811eecb3d" label="lyrics-like">oculórum meórum, et ipsum non</l><l xml:id="m-67384f9f-7ce7-46f5-ab2e-d53ac5aabdc5" facs="#m-5345f021-1aee-4018-9693-177d84a8b3f9" label="lyrics-like">Et lux perpétua “ lúceat éis.</l><l xml:id="m-1a413e46-03ac-4bbf-9e35-a657c430352c" facs="#m-86c976ad-9ae7-434f-9bb8-d734fb87677a" label="lyrics-like">est mécum.</l><l xml:id="m-634c0193-e419-403d-9ac5-2618ce3dbc5a" facs="#m-b69b791e-dbdb-4522-9560-26cb2a09f909" label="lyrics-like">Réquiem actérnam* dóna éls,</l><l xml:id="m-f263b7f3-ac61-4580-b3bb-000ed0e8b2b3" facs="#m-ecce360a-f740-4afd-a88c-2a3eca15c733" label="ambiguous">Psalm 55.</l><l xml:id="m-a1725e71-8d71-44ab-9c91-d67349dbd405" facs="#m-db00de99-26c5-4e8a-bed5-2a738ee8556c" label="lyrics-like">Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-86644f51-bfdb-4234-b8a9-de14ff6ca7b8" facs="#m-fbb8be75-1ca3-4c0a-9e0c-2e84af18c4f5" label="lyrics-like">Et lux perpétua * lúceat éis.</l><l xml:id="m-ddf15212-e598-4a07-b741-9ae0f41254da" facs="#m-e0ef6c20-a891-4b04-9fb3-240446254b1d" label="lyrics-like">Iserére méi, Déus, quóniam</l><l xml:id="m-825b9da8-dc0f-4fe1-903a-175fb1ff0dee" facs="#m-9ad6d2f5-b459-42d9-8c49-dfb6b6caa5c0" label="lyrics-like">1 conculcávit me hómo: * tóta</l><l xml:id="m-f8d7ebde-dcc6-432f-9b27-e66041976306" facs="#m-db3e47d2-1017-45c8-82c5-c07aa5cd53cb" label="ambiguous">Psalm 37. II.</l><l xml:id="m-9d670c51-63e7-48fc-8d73-b3e6ac5a6665" facs="#m-9bf41f41-7f91-4fc9-aea5-9436dccf95de" label="lyrics-like">die impúgnans tribulávit me.</l><l xml:id="m-aafb8ca3-822e-48d9-a67c-646e208eb8c5" facs="#m-3779e024-cba9-4831-bc1e-8efea2c28787" label="lyrics-like">TMici méi et próximi méi * ad¬</l><l xml:id="m-6d4ded68-6efa-44e9-b418-345c945c1584" facs="#m-5aecbff4-1126-46f9-a96d-2b8d4567339b" label="lyrics-like">Concuicavérunt me inimici méi</l><l xml:id="m-ae39ef0a-1a67-4525-9b2f-cbd5e43dfae5" facs="#m-f4578bd2-c25d-437e-8b79-2f4572489d65" label="lyrics-like">tóta die :* quóniam múlti bellán¬</l><l xml:id="m-5672dcc3-3444-4929-bd80-d0f8b7df6a27" facs="#m-682d857d-023b-4b04-933c-6b06d5785516" label="lyrics-like">A vérsum me appropinquavérunt</l><l xml:id="m-bea53b5d-f078-411e-b43b-a395e71165c0" facs="#m-5b4223c5-00d0-4a67-9745-1aa56544a3dc" label="lyrics-like">tes advérsum me.</l><l xml:id="m-2435eaab-b293-451b-9634-36e2235f2e59" facs="#m-21261b26-71f6-4ab5-ac6e-cffcbb407c87" label="lyrics-like">et stetérunt.</l><l xml:id="m-0f6614cc-d529-465a-9136-df052141a7fa" facs="#m-1ff7c54b-0e1b-414e-a9b4-4f7c5b917af1" label="lyrics-like">Ab altitúdine diéi timébo:* égo</l><l xml:id="m-45807e07-5006-4123-a068-3ae52cae84dd" facs="#m-48350949-b700-43de-bfbe-c0a2e1d2bbd5" label="lyrics-like">Et qui juxta me érant, de longe</l><l xml:id="m-079b711f-8c7e-4788-8629-9671094349fc" facs="#m-0c96f1a7-a58a-4db0-abf5-29e24863bb75" label="lyrics-like">vero in te sperábo.</l><l xml:id="m-6d6c38d7-42cd-4969-aec6-5797d05da070" facs="#m-489dd966-6bc4-422d-8b08-8021139b2787" label="lyrics-like">stetérunt :* et vim faciébant, qui</l><l xml:id="m-1ac8b72a-7d42-477a-bd02-efec39e23f7c" facs="#m-f14291f1-7871-46ed-a02f-3c6e667537e1" label="lyrics-like">quaerébant ánimam méam.</l><l xml:id="m-2b8c0d71-140b-4a9f-90dd-052be645ba5f" facs="#m-b0028c8b-3bcc-4cfc-ac9a-04d06b509bdf" label="lyrics-like">In Déo laudábo sermónes méos,</l><l xml:id="m-f4432364-ce36-4262-86b0-facd3c9b495c" facs="#m-e4b60b7a-8c66-445e-9381-fd4f4d1426a9" label="lyrics-like">Et qui inquirébant mála míhi,</l><l xml:id="m-b6376101-26db-4531-ab59-2c73dac88c75" facs="#m-ddc386af-2c05-4fc9-a131-b59c596f7fb7" label="lyrics-like">in Déo sperávi :* non timébo quid</l><l xml:id="m-f2fd93de-8011-47b3-a0ac-a64462301989" facs="#m-1edf01ea-33dd-4490-86e2-11caf97b7042" label="lyrics-like">locúti sunt vanitâtes: *et dólos</l><l xml:id="m-300513a0-f020-4ae8-b743-874531ea61c7" facs="#m-412be492-7352-464e-8e50-ea12dd1094b4" label="lyrics-like">fáciat míhi cáro.</l><l xml:id="m-c3e82220-5317-4b4b-9fdc-7f3919276ef8" facs="#m-bce3f38e-44fa-44f7-ad4e-e786e4240b04" label="lyrics-like">Tóta die vérba méa exsecrabán¬</l><l xml:id="m-e5952b30-6c14-4c20-b0bc-0acb4b982f57" facs="#m-fb8d4e4a-5082-4c52-b3c7-38e614460591" label="lyrics-like">tóta die meditabántur.</l><l xml:id="m-303aefeb-748e-4e08-b80d-466f607b85eb" facs="#m-8c0c134f-206a-434f-a75d-2acf40f04689" label="lyrics-like">Ego autem tamquam súrdus non</l><l xml:id="m-9ebf1ddb-83a2-4d66-9c71-62530c81267a" facs="#m-11dad0e3-6d10-4426-94dc-5736b322a08f" label="lyrics-like">tur : * advérsum me omnes cogita¬</l><l xml:id="m-4b804f17-b3cd-4b12-9959-f8590651bb29" facs="#m-d7e35e6b-7b43-47a9-881c-86ae83411857" label="lyrics-like">tiónes eórum in málum.</l><l xml:id="m-05ea0031-c64b-4f22-a2a7-59c72799357a" facs="#m-73cec1a5-d5c5-4b80-87c3-75a8bb7e5d95" label="lyrics-like">audiébam: “ et sicut mútus non</l><l xml:id="m-8bdb6db5-801b-4955-8c9d-f2e4234c8217" facs="#m-9147f92e-3857-4501-9d12-b5b44dc60f8b" label="lyrics-like">Inhabitábunt et abscóndent:</l><l xml:id="m-ecc92cf3-cd8e-45cb-bb75-3431b53e56c4" facs="#m-069b46de-44a4-4a3e-bb35-5f2f0a72bfd4" label="lyrics-like">apériens os súum.</l><l xml:id="m-562ee47d-7a3c-427f-ba98-d2545a81e7fb" facs="#m-f44de131-81be-40f8-9429-b9526e57be65" label="lyrics-like">Et fáctus sum sicut hómo non</l><l xml:id="m-14e41a13-72dd-4916-b0ae-12aea2bd52a5" facs="#m-424bcd0a-1771-490f-a0a7-7122a188e955" label="lyrics-like">Ipsi calcáneum méum observábunt.</l><l xml:id="m-e57ddbc5-e90c-4acd-ac75-6ac21cdee8b3" facs="#m-46a31dde-ac81-4978-852c-000cb0b48fc2" label="lyrics-like">áudiens, * et non hábens in óre súo</l><l xml:id="m-801cc9e5-c509-4e95-aac0-ceb8fcd29dbc" facs="#m-3e3683e3-98cb-447a-abb7-4f9c36f1d765" label="lyrics-like">Sicut sustinuérunt ánimam</l><l xml:id="m-d8cd7e3a-c4bd-4781-a749-a6c2496c9653" facs="#m-2afa9df0-4a4c-40a7-9c78-ef6a84173566" label="lyrics-like">redargutiónes.</l><l xml:id="m-1c0832f0-0576-4d57-81ce-52513bd5203a" facs="#m-b2f9168a-f4cc-4fce-a0e4-b0342906be53" label="lyrics-like">méam, pro nihilo sálvos fácies</l><l xml:id="m-39f6b3eb-b035-4144-a9eb-5e8b32446a23" facs="#m-8df5518b-c736-4f58-a981-51e9208316e3" label="lyrics-like">Quóniam in te, Dómine, spe¬</l><l xml:id="m-e7beaa7e-0d1e-43fa-88fc-5b74e5d22371" facs="#m-74099fd3-4a63-4a83-bf0b-5c36b4797633" label="lyrics-like">illos : X in fra pópulos confringes.</l><l xml:id="m-c1f101fb-4499-41f1-8831-ec034c52dc42" facs="#m-d0794265-6f3e-4fd1-b66e-18ccc054eb7f" label="lyrics-like">Déus, vitam méam annuntiávi</l><l xml:id="m-504e1b1e-8128-4a9c-b48c-8f86c17e1182" facs="#m-b9318995-1758-4ffe-9d37-b10f606a9733" label="lyrics-like">rávi: * tu exáudies me, Dómine</l><l xml:id="m-654136db-3234-4f36-9f65-2040bc4c0694" facs="#m-4b2abeb5-0875-479d-acdc-2231ccc3255c" label="lyrics-like">Déus méus.</l><l xml:id="m-428a41aa-0b7a-4a24-850d-afa5127096af" facs="#m-0e9c8765-6550-40fd-b357-5e1fa0aa6b40" label="lyrics-like">tibi:*posuísti lacrimas méas in</l><l xml:id="m-b352821a-26c6-4bf1-827f-171cc5bc5bab" facs="#m-51daa981-4474-4eaa-b6bf-f01190334901" label="lyrics-like">Quia dixi : Nequándo supergáu¬</l><l xml:id="m-9188fae8-f9f1-4f84-a8a8-eea504e6bb9c" facs="#m-37f3368c-8a87-48f8-bd70-cc67fb126ef8" label="lyrics-like">conspéctú túo.</l><l xml:id="m-361ab0c8-b6aa-4a24-8b52-f5a70223387a" facs="#m-fc7c944d-b53e-4294-b28f-ad88a04b572c" label="lyrics-like">Sicut et in promissióne túa:</l><l xml:id="m-6e5c15e7-3206-4ec7-af10-5ef87f5a6e98" facs="#m-7d36f507-d19b-4f12-9db3-b08662244541" label="lyrics-like">deant míhi inimici méi : * et dum</l><l xml:id="m-19772632-a486-441f-9dea-1ca0ab6643df" facs="#m-02cf3733-8e88-4d33-8458-d9e446bed9a8" label="lyrics-like">commovéntur pédes méi, super me</l><l xml:id="m-5eec0f41-4562-4d73-bc3e-1ed49f3f008a" facs="#m-8ecfc5b7-1a44-4f0d-bae0-a4652448c2a2" label="lyrics-like">tunc converténtur inimici méi re¬</l><l xml:id="m-a8256441-9d3a-4aed-ab4b-e3ce50532d86" facs="#m-21331568-bfc7-4e64-800c-9e57826fb96b" label="lyrics-like">trórsum.</l><l xml:id="m-63245d3b-241e-4c10-9245-6b853e021aa0" facs="#m-ea4a354d-d6e8-4de8-b629-71eda8539c94" label="lyrics-like">mágna toeúti sunt.</l><l xml:id="m-9f351acc-bb98-446e-b928-514bb90a01ea" facs="#m-bd960250-5c7a-4069-ac05-14e46f2fe31f" label="lyrics-like">Cuóniam égo in flagélla parátus</l><l xml:id="m-72f62ba8-2df8-4c67-aac2-3b5d953c9dd3" facs="#m-7686b8c7-0926-4e65-bf8c-1657d9f6da3d" label="lyrics-like">In quacúmque die invocávero</l><l xml:id="m-d555e11c-d93f-4c5b-ba56-6eddca99d213" facs="#m-787daf75-1dbd-4c15-b708-abc0a0c8326f" label="lyrics-like">sum:* et dólor méus in conspéctu</l><l xml:id="m-1bec7f6d-34b3-4eb4-b93b-044e07a30b86" facs="#m-41905423-3c22-48eb-b26b-8b76e3410b39" label="lyrics-like">te:* ecce cognóvi quóniam Déus</l><l xml:id="m-47f94f66-6091-4252-a49d-0f9388159556" facs="#m-0cbf8b17-4f12-4658-ada2-46c71ab9a166" label="lyrics-like">méo semper.</l><l xml:id="m-72d2131d-c5e7-46ea-ace7-28fa41a3a352" facs="#m-50e6452e-d6e6-4c12-b20c-fd06334ee110" label="lyrics-like">méus es.</l><l xml:id="m-8938bf0d-f1f4-4f91-805a-ab9f04ee7ab6" facs="#m-27c3bda1-3588-43de-94da-3d85e3651d58" label="lyrics-like">Quóniam iniquitátem méam an¬</l><l xml:id="m-7dd6e40f-71c1-4e55-a0e8-4e6b9f5d4929" facs="#m-ed9f0e5d-ee16-4a7c-90db-5dc318e3de8d" label="lyrics-like">In Déo laudábo vérbum, f in Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-6695e310-c33d-4e37-8ed9-7da2996a0f38" facs="#m-9ccf9d98-37e7-4ed6-b831-f980c15e7e0d" label="lyrics-like">mino laudábo sermónem:* in Déo</l><l xml:id="m-9cd8d3e1-61fc-40cd-8429-a7c0e9921db5" facs="#m-9b525816-8f1f-4fe1-bf9f-7e034bc9b285" label="lyrics-like">nuntiábo: * et cogitábo pro pec¬</l><l xml:id="m-fe5f8e6f-b785-4a95-936e-c8f01b20644b" facs="#m-a46650d3-1c32-4f1d-b778-4691bc2a93e5" label="lyrics-like">cáto méo.</l><l xml:id="m-8ea5b837-0b5c-4009-9ca0-54f9f316407f" facs="#m-2d8a94e6-14b9-4469-9761-e09cf4cda79d" label="lyrics-like">sperávi, non timébo quid fáciat</l><l xml:id="m-9c57e7b9-82e4-4d1e-b5b6-3251ecd87bc6" facs="#m-1f4274d8-5124-439b-84e1-14f1a3e19ad5" label="lyrics-like">Inimici autem méi vivunt, et con¬</l><l xml:id="m-c81b8e0c-e2c9-48a7-913d-bd2bed47ff55" facs="#m-f767ac7b-7427-41be-a2a2-6fa7257b3bd3" label="lyrics-like">míhi hómo.</l><l xml:id="m-dfc4ab24-126a-427e-a02d-5f908f61ef87" facs="#m-c08fdd72-712c-48c1-8e7a-d81a2ea79bea" label="lyrics-like">In me sunt, Déus, vóta túa,</l><l xml:id="m-ff70f2f9-44b2-4182-9be3-a3f0f499e27e" facs="#m-57b39986-5987-4ee5-9007-4e02dcae450d" label="lyrics-like">firmáti sunt súper me : * et multi¬</l><l xml:id="m-095f9e32-f972-4642-ad4b-5ed18cad938a" facs="#m-267b2a16-bde1-4203-96d9-977ae13de725" label="lyrics-like">quae réddam, laudatiónes tibi.</l><l xml:id="m-4451dc5b-174e-48ed-ac07-e7f3cb405296" facs="#m-e09a7b47-0414-49c7-ad3e-d47bfb4e0809" label="lyrics-like">plicáti sunt qui odérunt me inique.</l><l xml:id="m-0420b8e3-51d0-40e2-b70a-97d897f404e8" facs="#m-a9762081-130c-455f-9fe7-026ddee9c0af" label="lyrics-like">Qui retribuunt mála pro bónis,</l><l xml:id="m-33e376dc-e8d4-4ccf-8ba7-c9367cf6efd8" facs="#m-98617de0-0908-444e-b556-1780dcb43bb3" label="lyrics-like">Quóniam eripuisti ánimam méam</l><l xml:id="m-153779a5-411d-4716-a9e6-a9a3f9a10d2c" facs="#m-f67f965a-0ce7-40c4-acb0-c5fe17f26f31" label="lyrics-like">detrahébant mihi:“quóniam se¬</l><l xml:id="m-9f556ff1-851e-43e0-9bf0-f9c31f8b5df1" facs="#m-7f108a51-111a-4494-9bc7-82c948c84033" label="lyrics-like">de mórte, t et pédes méos de lá¬</l><l xml:id="m-45cfa1b2-0970-484b-b445-96635febc9dd" facs="#m-ae892103-fb81-40da-a8e4-8f5a2deab53c" label="lyrics-like">québar bonitâtem.</l><l xml:id="m-192d29a0-d0d6-44bb-a763-f3d0981d3c52" facs="#m-c6563a66-d71e-4ded-a8fd-6f97fb29acda" label="lyrics-like">psu:* ut pláceam coram Déo in</l><l xml:id="m-e1f2d73f-c369-4712-b8a8-ddf2102741c5" facs="#m-4f4379f9-2cbf-4c56-95b2-ccf38e61a34b" label="lyrics-like">Ne derelinquas me, Dómine, Déus</l><l xml:id="m-776d9ae1-d293-4288-b5b5-44af9b033d2b" facs="#m-688b4569-ed4f-42b9-8c0f-4b76fccc4317" label="lyrics-like">lúmine vivéntium.</l><l xml:id="m-962e1df2-0973-4c80-b9c4-76fda60efc4c" facs="#m-a000221e-5eb0-4409-b58d-28d335349555" label="lyrics-like">Réquiem actérnam* dóna éis,</l><l xml:id="m-9ae11d01-dbae-4293-b8de-3f8f3ef66cf3" facs="#m-83dd3078-d434-44a1-a7e4-2042ee7737c6" label="lyrics-like">méus : * ne discésseris a me.</l><l xml:id="m-fc0f9321-da63-4871-8284-29732cf5a57d" facs="#m-d5b55073-e170-42cd-871c-07f989af3faa" label="lyrics-like">Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-a6996a54-6c7a-47b7-9c86-b03d3d73c2db" facs="#m-e11238cc-befd-4137-a5e7-d715313f7831" label="lyrics-like">Inténde in adjutórium méum,*</l><l xml:id="m-91eaa787-0093-4211-9de8-d9107e59d93e" facs="#m-b8a41f2d-6674-46a2-bc9a-9f489e9fa6c5" label="lyrics-like">Et lux perpétua * lúceat éis.</l><l xml:id="m-d0eb9863-cd47-4f01-bcad-a86cad262354" facs="#m-665f16b3-20f6-44f9-b5f1-b2f34ff660fe" label="lyrics-like">Dómine Déus salútis méae.</l><l xml:id="m-1251ca71-7041-4813-a4f6-e9e1adb5de43" facs="#m-d690e017-bad7-4991-b075-853e7f3acbc9" label="text-like">The following is then said Kneeling:</l><l xml:id="m-da68cf72-c807-442e-8020-177c9c69f5e8" facs="#m-5f942d46-220e-4f55-b998-c8d02795c7dc" label="lyrics-like">Páter nóster. continued in sitence.</l><l xml:id="m-a3a77c79-2851-4b86-ac22-ce4c3fd9512e" facs="#m-1bad684f-e483-4807-b497-6badcb548317" label="lyrics-like">v. Et ne nos indúcas in tentatiónem. E. Sed libera nos a málo.</l><l xml:id="m-3fc6e771-aebf-44d4-a37b-e060c914bf19" facs="#m-928f0c22-ce4e-4e77-b8a7-abc85cbebd17" label="lyrics-like">V. A pórta inferi. B. Erue, Dómine, ánimas eórum.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>